# save: 10-ToThreed
# Runaway Five: talk to the band, Yes, walk into the strip under the tour bus, ride to Threed
# The original lags under sustained CPU load while the party walks left of x≈2182 here (every
# frame a little over budget): emu.py drops those part-way samples (LSTEP mid), and the body
# changes direction only outside that stretch, since a lag frame reads the previous frame's pad
# the TELEPORT_TO to the Threed tunnel: its SCREEN_TRANSITION's first fade step lags the original
# (3902), so the exit loop takes the extra PALETTE_UPLOAD_MODE wait (CPU time, see hotel-door)
# lag: 3923
# the TELEPORT_TO out of the tunnel to Threed the same (first step lags at 4921)
# lag: 4942
teleport 2224 6600 0; wait 10; 10 UP; until idle 300
